{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to rethink everything you know about chess! <strong>Chess Ultimate</strong> is a draft-based strategy game that combines the timeless appeal of chess with dynamic, game-changing twists. Build your dream team by drafting unique characters, each  with their own powerful abilities, and face off in battles where no two games are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/bombShowcase.gif?t=1744311463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outsmart your opponents with clever strategies, unleash your team, and dominate the board in this exciting reimagining of the classic game. Whether you're a chess enthusiast or a newcomer, <strong>Chess Ultimate</strong> offers fresh gameplay that keeps you coming back for more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to draft, strategize, and conquer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/extras/mageShowcase.gif?t=1744311463\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2580000?t=1744311463","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2580000?t=1744311463","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/5ada7f405d1a2d409a788bedd2cc587382f12efb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744311463","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580000/5ada7f405d1a2d409a788bedd2cc587382f12efb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744311463","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"n